02:24:34.180 --> 02:24:35.460
dojdou vlastně

02:24:35.460 --> 02:24:36.240
s těmi investicemi.

02:24:36.460 --> 02:24:36.860
Takže

02:24:36.860 --> 02:24:39.580
je to pak otázkou,

02:24:39.800 --> 02:24:40.540
